1
00:00:09,034 --> 00:00:11,354
[This program is suitable for viewers aged 13 and up.]

2
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:14,228
[May contain images, sounds,
and content that require viewer discretion.]

3
00:00:14,228 --> 00:00:15,678
[This program presents personal beliefs only.]

4
00:00:15,678 --> 00:00:17,358
[There is no intention to guide or persuade.
Viewer discretion is advised.]

5
00:00:17,358 --> 00:00:18,638
[Personal details and stories
presented in this program]

6
00:00:18,638 --> 00:00:20,317
[are shared with participants' voluntary consent.]

7
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,880
(UNSEEN: Battle for the Seer's Throne.)

8
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,525
(A mission taking Asia's top masters)

9
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,121
(across the boundary between the human world
and the spirit realm.)

10
00:00:34,734 --> 00:00:36,338
When this person was alive,

11
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:39,720
he leaned right here and watched like this.

12
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,920
Watching like this every day.

13
00:00:42,846 --> 00:00:43,904
Darn it!

14
00:00:44,182 --> 00:00:48,564
(Now five masters from the first group
have already advanced.)

15
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:51,749
Take the Seer's Throne immediately.

16
00:00:51,749 --> 00:00:55,703
(The masters who have taken their place
on the Seer's Throne are...)

17
00:00:55,757 --> 00:00:56,355
Dear.

18
00:00:59,711 --> 00:01:02,201
Master Hwang Hye-mi.

19
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:11,040
(And the other three masters who advanced are)

20
00:01:11,435 --> 00:01:13,017
(Master Boom,)

21
00:01:13,338 --> 00:01:15,280
(Master Ha Byung-yeol,)

22
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,816
(and Master Yiam.)

23
00:01:18,254 --> 00:01:23,416
(The spirit communication mission
at the cursed house in Rayong)

24
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:25,639
(for group two has just begun.)

25
00:01:26,558 --> 00:01:32,874
(And only five masters will advance to the next round.)

26
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,400
Let's just say it's a house in the middle of a field.

27
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,000
It looks like a temple, or a crematorium.

28
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:46,875
The construction workers died one by one.

29
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,787
Even though the house is finished now,

30
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:54,080
I still can't bring myself to move in.

31
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,320
This house is seriously haunted.

32
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:03,000
A shocking, inhuman tragedy happened here.

33
00:02:03,320 --> 00:02:04,120
A child.

34
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,040
Illegal trafficking.

35
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:08,160
Downstairs is a portal to the spirit world.

36
00:02:08,282 --> 00:02:09,960
This house reeks of death.

37
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:13,240
It's no place for the living.

38
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,520
It belongs to the dead.

39
00:02:17,944 --> 00:02:21,556
[Rayong]

40
00:02:22,689 --> 00:02:25,040
[Nok - Tarot Cards]

41
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:29,600
(The second I saw the house, I thought
the design looked just like... Umm...)

42
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,200
(A spirit house.)

43
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,314
(I let my brother go inside first.)

44
00:02:40,313 --> 00:02:42,280
(He shares my body.)

45
00:02:51,417 --> 00:02:55,320
(Before I was born, my mom had a miscarriage.)

46
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:59,753
(It's like he's been with me ever since I was little.)

47
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,600
(I toss coins to open the path)

48
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:34,120
(because my brother is guiding me.)

49
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:41,080
(Sometimes it's a whisper.
Sometimes a voice in my head.)

50
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:45,280
(I think being a psychic was the calling
he was meant to be born for.)

51
00:03:58,887 --> 00:04:02,521
(Standing in the middle of the house,
facing the front entrance,)

52
00:04:02,521 --> 00:04:05,984
(I got intense goosebumps.)

53
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:12,268
(It's one of the rare times I heard
my brother's voice so clearly.)

54
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:19,000
(He said,)

55
00:04:19,535 --> 00:04:20,764
("Go down.")

56
00:04:32,388 --> 00:04:35,348
What events took place here
that are tied to this house?

57
00:04:43,332 --> 00:04:45,989
First off, ghosts or spiritual energies

58
00:04:46,932 --> 00:04:50,510
[Nok - Tarot Cards]may not be strong enough to appear visibly in daylight,

59
00:04:50,732 --> 00:04:52,332
but their power is still all there.

60
00:04:52,940 --> 00:04:57,038
I was talking to the voices in my head
and the visions I saw.

61
00:04:57,038 --> 00:04:58,546
Just not out loud.

62
00:05:14,390 --> 00:05:16,036
It was probably built for two purposes.

63
00:05:16,699 --> 00:05:17,896
Built for what else?

64
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,959
For...

65
00:05:22,399 --> 00:05:24,759
(It was probably built for two purposes.)

66
00:05:24,759 --> 00:05:29,399
(First, to store something family-related.)

67
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:35,559
(Second, to put something there
that shouldn't be there.)

68
00:05:35,799 --> 00:05:36,951
That's spot-on.

69
00:05:36,951 --> 00:05:37,399
Yes.

70
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:38,919
- You told me that yourself.
- Yes.

71
00:05:39,119 --> 00:05:39,919
And what happened to him?

72
00:05:41,719 --> 00:05:43,199
Probably involved a car too.

73
00:05:43,695 --> 00:05:45,079
Injustice.

74
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,634
Finances weren't good either.

75
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:50,888
(People linked to this house face accidents,)

76
00:05:51,239 --> 00:05:53,880
(lose loved ones,)

77
00:05:54,383 --> 00:05:57,172
(and stay trapped in the same old problems.)

78
00:05:57,239 --> 00:05:58,839
Whoa, she's the real deal!

79
00:05:59,839 --> 00:06:00,639
Whoa.

80
00:06:04,799 --> 00:06:08,479
What happened to the people connected to this house?

81
00:06:10,799 --> 00:06:13,839
I feel like there was an accident,

82
00:06:17,746 --> 00:06:18,558
and...

83
00:06:23,496 --> 00:06:24,319
I'm sorry.

84
00:06:33,510 --> 00:06:34,226
Don't hold it in.

85
00:06:35,808 --> 00:06:36,983
- Let your feelings out.
- Okay.

86
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:38,839
And they said

87
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:42,541
they never got justice.

88
00:06:57,439 --> 00:07:00,955
I'm sorry. I don't know what's wrong with me.

89
00:07:14,439 --> 00:07:15,148
Are you okay?

90
00:07:20,364 --> 00:07:23,124
Can you explain why this happened?

91
00:07:23,124 --> 00:07:27,347
Even though it wasn't my fault, it's confusing
how it suddenly...

92
00:07:28,724 --> 00:07:29,733
Hit me out of nowhere.

93
00:07:29,733 --> 00:07:31,269
It's the Hierophant reversed.

94
00:07:31,644 --> 00:07:34,646
That was a year when the sacred spirits
weren't protecting you.

95
00:07:43,404 --> 00:07:45,404
The woman asked me to tell you,

96
00:07:46,724 --> 00:07:49,284
"Don't worry. I'll look after the house."

97
00:07:58,422 --> 00:08:02,060
(Seeing the house from afar,
its feng shui bothered me immediately.)

98
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:14,620
I, Siwatat Durongsak, make this invocation
to Phra Mae Thorani.

99
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:18,860
May Phra Mae Thorani bear divine witness
to my auspicious deeds today,

100
00:08:18,860 --> 00:08:21,144
so that it may succeed as intended.

101
00:08:23,153 --> 00:08:24,285
Will they let me go down to the basement?

102
00:08:28,908 --> 00:08:29,828
Why was it built?

103
00:08:32,718 --> 00:08:33,868
Attachment.

104
00:09:07,890 --> 00:09:10,868
At first touch, I felt like gagging... like...

105
00:09:11,139 --> 00:09:14,268
Something inside me told me not to go in.

106
00:09:15,019 --> 00:09:17,584
I rarely ever feel like this.

107
00:09:17,584 --> 00:09:20,108
It's like watching a spirit medium get possessed.

108
00:09:28,250 --> 00:09:29,348
To keep a loved one inside.

109
00:09:29,949 --> 00:09:31,937
A memorial of longing.

110
00:09:47,723 --> 00:09:50,042
The basement room was intended...

111
00:09:54,068 --> 00:09:54,680
There is...

112
00:09:56,166 --> 00:09:58,731
Did he want to keep a corpse in there?

113
00:10:06,832 --> 00:10:08,290
In my practice,

114
00:10:08,290 --> 00:10:10,887
I always pay my respects at the front door first.

115
00:10:13,138 --> 00:10:16,900
In my vision, everything went pitch black,
like a TV screen shutting off.

116
00:10:27,736 --> 00:10:31,296
The second I walked in and opened the door,
I got my answer.

117
00:10:32,546 --> 00:10:36,511
The front door, the middle of the house,
the back door, and the back window...

118
00:10:36,511 --> 00:10:37,901
They're all aligned and facing each other.
It's called a direction.

119
00:10:37,933 --> 00:10:39,899
In traditional terms, it's called a spirit corridor.

120
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,799
I could instantly sense

121
00:10:45,991 --> 00:10:49,936
[Karn - Tarot Cards/Oracle Cards]
that the owner couldn't live here after building it.

122
00:10:49,936 --> 00:10:52,656
First, because he built it purely on his own whim,

123
00:10:53,194 --> 00:10:54,317
just following personal whim.

124
00:10:56,576 --> 00:11:00,302
That caused a certain energy to build up inside.

125
00:11:00,387 --> 00:11:01,862
The longer you stay, the worse it gets.

126
00:11:03,696 --> 00:11:09,226
Back then, I didn't believe we needed someone
to check the feng shui before building a house.

127
00:11:09,846 --> 00:11:13,618
I just didn't buy it. I just closed my eyes
and tossed the marker down.

128
00:11:13,832 --> 00:11:14,634
Didn't care if it was right or wrong.

129
00:11:14,634 --> 00:11:15,253
Yeah, right or wrong, I didn't care.

130
00:11:15,253 --> 00:11:16,183
I just went with what I liked.

131
00:11:16,183 --> 00:11:17,573
Just what I liked.

132
00:11:19,896 --> 00:11:20,683
I'm so dizzy.

133
00:11:23,194 --> 00:11:24,124
My heart is racing.

134
00:11:26,807 --> 00:11:27,394
The door.

135
00:11:28,859 --> 00:11:32,097
Between this window and this door,
there's an energy constantly passing through.

136
00:11:33,583 --> 00:11:34,427
I feel like crying.

137
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:40,871
The moment I stepped into this room, it felt strange.

138
00:11:45,125 --> 00:11:46,846
I tried to steady my mind

139
00:11:46,846 --> 00:11:49,047
and communicated, saying, "I come with respect."

140
00:11:49,111 --> 00:11:55,129
Please have mercy. If there's anything
you wish for me to know,

141
00:11:55,776 --> 00:11:58,313
please let me know.

142
00:12:00,536 --> 00:12:02,385
All I can feel is overwhelming sorrow.

143
00:12:03,536 --> 00:12:05,004
She's telling me to stay out of it.

144
00:12:10,187 --> 00:12:11,491
I come with compassion.

145
00:12:12,346 --> 00:12:13,180
Please have mercy. Please.

146
00:12:13,233 --> 00:12:17,017
Please...

147
00:12:17,412 --> 00:12:21,216
All beings, all spirits, if you have a message for me,

148
00:12:21,719 --> 00:12:22,392
please...

149
00:12:28,035 --> 00:12:29,852
I see a wooden bed. A bed.

150
00:12:32,620 --> 00:12:36,799
A woman is sitting on a wooden bed.

151
00:12:39,056 --> 00:12:40,176
Really?

152
00:12:40,593 --> 00:12:42,896
That means Master Karn truly sensed it.

153
00:12:42,902 --> 00:12:43,276
Yes.

154
00:12:43,329 --> 00:12:45,296
That was your ex-girlfriend, right?

155
00:12:45,296 --> 00:12:45,659
Yes.

156
00:12:46,076 --> 00:12:46,674
Was it a wooden bed?

157
00:12:47,572 --> 00:12:48,673
A wooden bed. A teakwood bed.

158
00:12:50,671 --> 00:12:53,396
What answers did you get from going inside this place?

159
00:12:53,963 --> 00:12:59,018
In my vision, I sensed an older woman.

160
00:12:59,638 --> 00:13:02,363
She looked elderly and very kind-hearted.

161
00:13:02,577 --> 00:13:05,420
It felt like she was worried about someone.

162
00:13:05,420 --> 00:13:07,151
A voice told me

163
00:13:14,697 --> 00:13:15,707
that she's worried.

164
00:13:19,730 --> 00:13:21,787
Back in 2018,

165
00:13:21,985 --> 00:13:25,459
there was a strong chance of an accident, an injury,

166
00:13:25,854 --> 00:13:27,457
possibly losing a leg.

167
00:13:27,682 --> 00:13:30,987
And also being cheated or taken advantage of.

168
00:13:32,951 --> 00:13:34,267
All connected to this house.

169
00:13:34,267 --> 00:13:36,681
Second, there are lawsuits, bankruptcy,

170
00:13:36,969 --> 00:13:38,797
or financial fraud.

171
00:13:39,256 --> 00:13:39,620
Yes.

172
00:13:40,657 --> 00:13:44,387
I co-signed a car loan for my employee,
and he scammed me. I had to keep flying to Bueng Kan.

173
00:13:45,092 --> 00:13:49,463
Then my business partner cheated me too.
I've been fighting lawsuits over the car and the house.

174
00:13:50,393 --> 00:13:52,061
I tried to connect with the spirit,

175
00:13:52,061 --> 00:13:55,352
but it seemed like they didn't like the deities
I worship.

176
00:13:56,293 --> 00:13:59,697
Oh, my gosh!

177
00:14:10,775 --> 00:14:12,271
I got a little annoyed.

178
00:14:12,271 --> 00:14:14,665
I'm trying to talk to you, and you're ignoring me.

179
00:14:16,332 --> 00:14:18,561
There's a ghost. The ghost card showed up.

180
00:14:19,015 --> 00:14:20,511
The spirit wouldn't talk to me.

181
00:14:27,949 --> 00:14:30,546
I had to invoke a deity who could communicate with them

182
00:14:30,546 --> 00:14:31,775
on my behalf.

183
00:14:36,081 --> 00:14:38,220
The bad things in this house

184
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:41,480
aren't necessarily supernatural.

185
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:44,782
They're tangible, real-world issues

186
00:14:44,881 --> 00:14:47,614
like greed.

187
00:14:49,388 --> 00:14:51,237
From what I channeled, they said

188
00:14:51,721 --> 00:14:55,081
this bedroom holds a fear of being attacked,

189
00:14:56,641 --> 00:15:00,664
afraid someone might come shoot or harm you.

190
00:15:00,664 --> 00:15:01,113
Yes.

191
00:15:02,406 --> 00:15:04,881
My family was gunned down in a massacre.

192
00:15:06,125 --> 00:15:08,721
Back in Chatchai's era, I was terrified.

193
00:15:10,101 --> 00:15:12,979
So I cast the shells to ask what happened.

194
00:15:16,698 --> 00:15:19,562
They revealed a traumatic event,

195
00:15:19,562 --> 00:15:22,491
or a severe tragedy that took place.

196
00:15:23,292 --> 00:15:24,628
Um...

197
00:15:24,778 --> 00:15:28,251
The cowrie shells said there may be

198
00:15:29,395 --> 00:15:30,848
politics...

199
00:15:30,891 --> 00:15:32,581
Politics might be involved,

200
00:15:47,721 --> 00:15:49,944
This house is no joke. I can feel

201
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:53,353
something bad in here.

202
00:15:55,266 --> 00:15:57,511
[Spoil - Tarot Cards/Indian Astrology]
The moment I walked in, my hair stood on end.

203
00:16:08,487 --> 00:16:08,839
Suffering.

204
00:16:12,869 --> 00:16:13,659
Everyone suffered here.

205
00:16:14,385 --> 00:16:14,889
That's true.

206
00:16:22,787 --> 00:16:24,978
(The energy down here is intense.)

207
00:16:28,398 --> 00:16:30,097
(When I sat there,)

208
00:16:30,428 --> 00:16:32,160
(my ears were ringing.)

209
00:16:35,077 --> 00:16:37,428
(I felt like I couldn't bear to go in.)

210
00:16:51,034 --> 00:16:53,406
(And I sensed that in here,)

211
00:16:54,145 --> 00:16:56,785
(there's a female spirit,)

212
00:16:57,767 --> 00:16:58,985
(who's in deep torment.)

213
00:17:06,745 --> 00:17:08,700
Because he intended to build it for,

214
00:17:09,185 --> 00:17:11,457
or for the people living here,

215
00:17:11,725 --> 00:17:13,274
to stay with his family and loved ones.

216
00:17:14,931 --> 00:17:19,494
There might be debt involved, forcing him

217
00:17:19,655 --> 00:17:25,715
into taking out loans
or mortgaging the land deed with the bank.

218
00:17:26,025 --> 00:17:26,356
Yes.

219
00:17:27,531 --> 00:17:32,277
We've now heard the answers from all eight psychics

220
00:17:32,277 --> 00:17:34,607
in the Rayong house group.

221
00:17:34,842 --> 00:17:38,390
Joining us to make the decision today is...

222
00:17:48,201 --> 00:17:50,355
Uncle Tik, welcome.

223
00:17:51,450 --> 00:17:56,395
Right now, I have the list of psychics
Uncle Tik has chosen.

224
00:18:01,368 --> 00:18:05,461
And the first psychic advancing to the next round is...

225
00:18:07,555 --> 00:18:10,826
"You've already done your best, Uncle,
no need to fix anything."

226
00:18:10,955 --> 00:18:12,462
I was most impressed by that person.

227
00:18:13,017 --> 00:18:13,658
Khae.

228
00:18:18,863 --> 00:18:21,780
(If anyone dominated today, it has to be Khae.)

229
00:18:24,399 --> 00:18:25,692
(Whose energy fits this house best?)

230
00:18:25,884 --> 00:18:26,836
(It's definitely Khae.)

231
00:18:28,951 --> 00:18:32,821
And the second psychic Uncle Tik

232
00:18:33,152 --> 00:18:36,387
has chosen to advance to the next round is...

233
00:18:37,267 --> 00:18:37,723
Nok.

234
00:18:47,387 --> 00:18:49,915
Congratulations to Master Khae

235
00:18:50,139 --> 00:18:52,091
and Master Nok!

236
00:18:52,828 --> 00:18:53,884
And as for the first group,

237
00:18:53,884 --> 00:18:57,508
we need to choose the psychics
who will advance to the next round,

238
00:18:57,508 --> 00:18:58,708
three more psychics.

239
00:18:58,708 --> 00:19:04,108
Those three will be decided by a vote
from our three judges,

240
00:19:04,108 --> 00:19:06,428
on who deserves to move forward.

241
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,264
Okay.

242
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:15,920
And now, the names of the next three advancing psychics

243
00:19:15,920 --> 00:19:17,424
are right here in my hands.

244
00:19:17,424 --> 00:19:17,936
And they are...

245
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:24,760
The first psychic advancing to the next round is...

246
00:19:29,280 --> 00:19:30,360
Master...

247
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,680
Matoom!

248
00:19:42,301 --> 00:19:44,085
Congratulations to Master Matoom

249
00:19:44,085 --> 00:19:46,813
on becoming the third psychic to advance.

250
00:19:46,877 --> 00:19:47,453
And...

251
00:19:47,612 --> 00:19:51,444
The next psychic advancing is...

252
00:19:55,164 --> 00:19:57,164
Man, this is heartbreaking.

253
00:20:00,427 --> 00:20:02,587
Congratulations to Master...

254
00:20:04,819 --> 00:20:06,565
Top!

255
00:20:14,481 --> 00:20:16,881
Now, in the Rayong house group,

256
00:20:16,881 --> 00:20:19,409
we're down to the final four psychics.

257
00:20:20,913 --> 00:20:23,721
Only one spot remains

258
00:20:23,721 --> 00:20:26,001
to advance to the next round.

259
00:20:29,105 --> 00:20:31,761
And the final psychic from the Rayong house group

260
00:20:31,761 --> 00:20:34,406
advancing to the next round is...

261
00:20:39,511 --> 00:20:40,471
Master...

262
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:44,364
Weiyi!

263
00:20:59,603 --> 00:21:02,043
